<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
</head>

<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#f5f7fb;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">

<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#f5f7fb;padding:40px 20px;">
<tr>
<td align="center">

<table width="700" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"
style="background:#ffffff;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.08);">

<!-- Header -->
<tr>
<td style="background:#dc3545;color:#ffffff;padding:30px;text-align:center;">

<h1 style="margin:0;font-size:30px;">
⚠️ Momak ERP
</h1>

<p style="margin-top:10px;font-size:18px;">
Low Account Balance Alert
</p>

</td>
</tr>

<!-- Body -->
<tr>
<td style="padding:35px;">

<p style="font-size:17px;">
Hello,
</p>

<p style="font-size:16px;color:#555;line-height:1.8;">
This is an automated notification from
<strong>Momak ERP</strong>.

The account below has fallen below the configured minimum balance threshold and requires immediate attention.
</p>

<table width="100%" cellpadding="12" cellspacing="0"
style="border-collapse:collapse;border:1px solid #e5e5e5;margin-top:25px;">

<tr style="background:#f8f9fa;">
<td width="220"><strong>Account Name</strong></td>
<td><%= @account.name %></td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td><strong>Current Balance</strong></td>
<td style="color:#dc3545;font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;">
KES <%= number_with_delimiter(@account.balance) %>
</td>
</tr>

<tr style="background:#f8f9fa;">
<td><strong>Minimum Balance</strong></td>
<td>KES 7,500</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td><strong>Status</strong></td>
<td>
<span style="background:#dc3545;color:white;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:20px;">
Low Balance
</span>
</td>
</tr>

</table>

<div style="margin-top:30px;padding:20px;background:#fff4e5;border-left:5px solid #ffc107;border-radius:6px;">

<strong>Recommended Action</strong>

<ul style="margin-top:12px;color:#555;line-height:1.8;">
<li>Review recent transactions.</li>
<li>Top up the account immediately.</li>
<li>Monitor the account to prevent service interruptions.</li>
</ul>

</div>

<div style="text-align:center;margin-top:35px;">

<a href="https://flow.momak.co.ke/m_accounts"
style="
display:inline-block;
background:#198754;
color:#ffffff;
padding:15px 35px;
font-size:17px;
font-weight:bold;
text-decoration:none;
border-radius:8px;">
Open Momak ERP
</a>

</div>

<p style="margin-top:40px;color:#666;line-height:1.8;">
This notification was automatically generated because the account balance has dropped below the configured threshold of
<strong>KES 7,500</strong>.
</p>

</td>
</tr>

<!-- Footer -->
<tr>
<td style="background:#f8f9fa;padding:25px;text-align:center;color:#777;font-size:13px;">

<strong>Momak ERP</strong><br>

Business Management System

<br><br>

🌐 https://flow.momak.co.ke/m_accounts

</td>
</tr>

</table>

</td>
</tr>
</table>

</body>
</html>